<header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated</p><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p class="lede">The short version of how Digivated works.</p></header>
<article class="article-body"><h2>Sharing your work</h2><p>Only submit work you’re allowed to share, and keep the details accurate. A free launch goes live on its launch date once your badge is verified. Instant Publishing ($3, paid once) goes live as soon as you pay and takes an open homepage spot for 7 days.</p><h2>Digivated Membership</h2><p><a href="/membership">Digivated Membership</a> costs $5 USD, paid once. It’s not a subscription. It includes one project spotlight and full member News summaries. Five recent stories are free for everyone.</p><p>A spotlight needs a working project and suitable artwork, and we review it before it runs. Paying doesn’t bypass the listing rules or guarantee traffic, engagement, or sales. Refunded, charged-back, or revoked purchases lose their access. Gumroad handles checkout, receipts, taxes, and the terms shown at checkout.</p><h2>Previous purchases</h2><p>Older purchases keep what they included. Prompt Packet licenses work on the <a href="/access">access page</a>. Founding Membership licenses and purchase emails work on the <a href="/membership#member-sign-in">member sign-in page</a>. A promotion bought earlier can still be submitted for review. We no longer sell these on their own.</p><h2>Independent projects</h2><p>Listed projects are run by other people. Check their terms and privacy practices before you use or buy anything. A listing isn’t a guarantee of how a project performs.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digivated on X</a> for help with the site or a listing.</p></article>
